  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Fixed\n- Dependency reducer: recompute allPackageIds after each removal so guard packages (Serilog, JWT) are released once their partners are removed\n- Content comparison in bulk cleanup and path de-duplication in the formatter are now case-sensitive on non-Windows platforms so real changes and files are no longer dropped\n### Changed\n- Dependencies - Updated FunFair.CodeAnalysis to 7.2.30.2708\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Extensions.Linq to 1.0.168.2245\n- cscleanup is now published as self-contained ReadyToRun tool packages for linux-x64 and linux-arm64 only, instead of native AOT, because third-party trimming and AOT warnings block native AOT publishing; Windows and macOS runtime identifiers are no longer published\n- cscleanup now runs with InvariantGlobalization enabled, and its package includes a readme and project URL metadata\n- Dependencies - Updated Credfeto.Version.Information.Generator to 1.0.145.1863\n- Formatter and cleanup directory scans now skip .git, bin and obj folders during enumeration and treat bin as generated output, so build-output copies are no longer processed",
